# AWS-0104: unrestricted egress on the EKS control-plane security group.
# The control plane must reach the AWS API, the container registry, and the
# node ENIs. Restricting its egress is not supported by EKS and would break
# cluster operation. Node and workload egress are governed separately by
# Kubernetes NetworkPolicy; see guides/networking.md.
AVD-AWS-0104

# AZU-0041: AKS API server not limited to specific IPs.
# Trivy scans the module in isolation, where authorized_ip_ranges is an
# input variable with no default, and it cannot evaluate the validation block
# on that variable. That block rejects an empty list at plan time, so a
# deployment with an open API server cannot be applied from these modules.
# See modules/azure-aks/variables.tf.
AVD-AZU-0041
